{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1580,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "55de4ce263af14817647562a7fd0854a4cb17a23",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efcfb59251730f0b223bb9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝴蝶兰……你这个软弱之徒！\r\n竟然因这点不适就有所动摇，\r\n简直滑天下之大稽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb7177a137afa6e33651be5d387a661f5d8f08d8616e09e2e71669b9b2e04da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8656108a196d0d895d6f65b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是愚策，多试几次总能碰对。\r\n然而，能够支撑的身体和时间是有限的。\r\n一旦耗尽便会枯朽……千万，不要忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43fcb35c9c115a41345ee49d8e7a8fc46df708b5edb90dcc5802e5ec0bb016c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da351f27de305d598c65bbe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我现在跟你无话可说。\r\n退下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae48bc093b374ba49069595eda6cc0530c06b4e78e727e8caf3e57fde58390e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c04137dafa056c3ba4857adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……调整得很好。对这份工作的谢意，\r\n就让我用完美的胜利来展现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d4cc25a1d06de64611f3b96c4415a5a96403cd10a8ea15cf217ab4317d522f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dafcf36843b91be870df65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将对手彻底击溃，\r\n让这个名字响彻世间。\r\n……那才是战斗的真正价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f57e88021b3478ae8c3a5c19781f52800c3ae8f2767f20a031d65097290400",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d31e905383052b86f70948ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利乃是必然。\r\n即便如此，我也绝不会掉以轻心。绝不。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c80f9e9bc0db7c59190ff562803567928dfd52ce5f67650ae159fc90ea2b749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4429d84a94ef7182fe72808b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "亲手培育的花朵绽放时的喜悦，\r\n也让你好好品味一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4873c872feee45f2cf87ee0782af9f241caa00365e64774ee9be3a8021aaaaf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106b52da1f8ff6c42b1b8bf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎样的足迹，都会成为通往花园的路标。\r\n端正态度面对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1bba1f45172df6edf0a7b2b4a2c5e15aaa62c2002820ee6e54c4625f001ccdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22f9b536cfd59a2accbd2f7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能毫无后顾之忧地奔跑，\r\n是何等的幸福……这个机会，\r\n我绝不会白白浪费。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17c561d586b2d161fa415288404b10250395e5c76392a35606b4faed39bb6697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67460f056e17d2d9b7c4bccd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能奔跑已是万幸。\r\n时间到了，我们走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0215c0adc3dcbbe62c33211dd1ab613cdde5837db83ba7a3004416d162d3c49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b143c4aef8d281c61b3777e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比拼硬实力吗。\r\n……有意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "137ba92c09dd034010b2adf6b74b3d074ad64cc2de61c82e15958e1795757c9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36edd6d2534567e782eab3cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利不需要什么顺风。\r\n有我这一副身躯就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "033414f63545059765a27f6cf3638ebf079056edfb756bb3d245e16a016601a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e20a5061d22d3e4baf3efa7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这点程度的调整不足，\r\n不是什么大问题。走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21832d50da6e2f728b47680f10d00615a4b4bde4aff937bd89c6690e7c2b3f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc8f224e8f1c36feefa73e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将状态不佳表露于外简直愚不可及。\r\n你也要努力不被人看穿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b6f495bcbcdedc8fbdb564993e2e51cde082dfe9f5e1e161605b8b192ed261c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a47b810ff134da4fe6dcec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别担心。\r\n逆转劣势才称得上是华丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fa417f654cc726ed7e8e83777ad1807d97b1409c332801d21fb7c8c99df8658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35d9335c7d3fceaba46b4e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算死咬着石头不放，我也要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "026db08fcea14ffa75c2b6088d36d1467df6a63d4385c487a5b45018c1b89b00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ddc3b68552d658bf914843",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哈！\r\n我的脚步，可不会因为这点程度而停下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a2c3e826cecc74dcf248e78c4c3023ae202c9b05032f8e9aa4d632be8849aa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8842ee681e1c30d6ef7e63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别露出那种表情。\r\n我的强大，\r\n你应该是最清楚的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "932905200407761c23d94de2d78ce4b83ba665085a949ceed712976eb66b0e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c64c41fd64d80d4af0fc38bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7025f7cc6d8e56e328c0643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:730206e172e138b5d06bffcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0157e6aed55c5c02d6a5db10de6381ff48cf5d42afdf83c802629cb18e71b92a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a905b2b34257bd7c1c3d5e20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻而易举。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bac9d59c451d7f3dfdc1f3c3d08d20c3252d0f635fbdedd7c3ffe1e7792aff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f3e12b301c6e8ae5e79e4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太难看了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d3c40e2c391dd11e86f5cd8829810c340db14aab68094cfc4ad555f9aac78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5963cd74c18352cd2beb0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须重新审视一番了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8aacf83f10418bef2bc3275a180941d364fa56124d083d8a6874585f1274ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8a6515672bed1041d223b4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e503174d4061b5a441fdf881cb3104cb5ae97793c7d54f43b96980f665783a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d77630d060ee51afd7cfc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去游泳吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6585b5ab1452aea783b9234123b16b8ddec61c38092bc805e1554194bcea7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abae6b82c79824c7b6c4e603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向你道谢。我收了个好徒弟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08589631cf881d62d99203c9cd4492faecaa3ab74013118d9934cd27c98aaf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa70cdbfd63a3fdcb40cbfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要继续精进，不可懈怠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b7f76a0eb04d3849e08f4fe677c88b6aeef326eec45970ccd4ab76bff667e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb2da241eb15464d819ae85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e503174d4061b5a441fdf881cb3104cb5ae97793c7d54f43b96980f665783a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f222f0c4b1b8f76ccd5f3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下，那名为胜利的大轮之花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6e3948b0adb7b8ad6481d8d6bb055b546fa38cc2d12a0b583e097b4a8088ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc3cf6a95085fa8d185ba44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要继续精进，不可懈怠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b7f76a0eb04d3849e08f4fe677c88b6aeef326eec45970ccd4ab76bff667e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:361d4fbd47fec9d6a150aa1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能毫无后顾之忧地奔跑，\r\n是何等的幸福……这个机会，\r\n我绝不会白白浪费。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17c561d586b2d161fa415288404b10250395e5c76392a35606b4faed39bb6697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a2087a67db99a7a992d886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利乃是必然。\r\n即便如此，我也绝不会掉以轻心。绝不。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c80f9e9bc0db7c59190ff562803567928dfd52ce5f67650ae159fc90ea2b749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08953f1efb246268e1e1ac88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要继续精进，不可懈怠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b7f76a0eb04d3849e08f4fe677c88b6aeef326eec45970ccd4ab76bff667e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a410461baf64eb13410fcb72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d35d594e198dd2e2bc00a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我预估得太乐观了……唯有继续精进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c679d7bd9147edb982b87ead241db92836ce441a46bc6845c022b7b110e6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d891b21e1cacc68f0c845979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……虽说没丢人现眼，但还是太难堪了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd0ce861478563da7e2657adfcf7b749bb8e02bea3ec7aa481ee4e965d24720",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a1f4e14af1d42b3a361ac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈……就这点本事还自称为师，真是个笑话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa99f89a221ad3055d1dad73136411cd947bb1ad6008940c5c263b56d0684cb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36d01df513026641e91304f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个……软弱之徒……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e59bf67cc725a9651278b5edcbb935ecbb1b002c32ab148f8c94050428f67f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec96312c36d82f2514f48fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们凭执念让其绽放的花朵，真是美丽啊。对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c176709bc5981b55ae14f488a5f2c33c8cdbc65de131abead27a9fe6739eb89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d64ed83cd41ebc470d8c03c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以此胜利为粮……去绽放出更为巨大的花朵吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "408899d6fc25ed4fd2b1944f716c7acd695e4f97fdee0678baec1a23edc2e429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd5f78267749af79879b1523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来交手吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4370c67e8b45309b1aa6e7975e2f2fc03cd3943e75f98c1eafbac9449008fec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e23ea489f870ccf16e28a73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此时不绽放，更待何时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d3e4e19f0ab4709fdb6e6f557b83ee3100f106a31d78fb129b86dacf8ba01eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3abae2d3ce846839fb0e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去报答吧。报答让我萌芽的大恩。\r\n绝不会让这一切以一场庄周梦蝶告终——\r\n这，就是我的觉悟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb262c286e35239140c307c9aa7259f576d2957454b9335569d1b9804e2b2a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:691ada285df67a96285c8f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——在这里也绽放一朵花吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2e662d28e6f08575b6e9d9ad504d68701db662331f94da4edb68f873b851ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593961ad8e949018d18e9ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下吧。这通过剑舞千锤百炼而成的绽放之姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b696777b17e4611c694558dce50587f235065570a6b172e27e72f22b1efe68f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:156bfee9494a078180f6c264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刮目相看吧，这花儿的生存之道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "721306949ae5a5e062655d095d03040983becdfeb0f2da3edb2cd4eaa13df0db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29890d537380f82ac32f9b31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呵。真没想到，\r\n居然会收训练员为徒。\r\n可别辜负了为师的期待啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d619b1fce9eed5243b71449138ae465f0d1c8a88477ae9f53fee09c69162222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103400349c6d1dacd834f4cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是有着悠久传统的制服。要带着骄傲穿戴整齐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c837d0d9beb67877c030ad1f8c205d4272a51468e9732ffe1122e7790a80e809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be73b97928a746557373969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随观看角度不同，韵味也会改变，真是套充满意趣的服装呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daaa1bbf3f975f7a78148c6fea93dee19fcd11c9c8a0db3b4cc715149f165073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca318cbdb73b6326b4a43fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错啊……感觉我的心中也绽放出了花朵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a157e21fd5cfa695062fd422d65913c783772447d99e4c5ce1960854e5a2c1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d16e05c9480e191f9f6fa06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打的蝴蝶结，可是以绝对不会松开而闻名的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f336751b2119b045430071a2ee28d110734d4518bff0d45d01d4c44fb2b8f205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7516097b9ba8b3465e569415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……偶尔你也要不要试着跳一舞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f6ef5227500e6c60d28897cdee435bb21c3bdee31d2661dbc350b01c54e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52cfbc576aa579b59788a8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一次重新系紧腰带时，我都在叩问自己的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5793809dc94b03f108d3a7c01046ee4baca7669134ce10ab3880650fab0759",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9ce098263eee3875e2ecb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裁制得真好。做这件衣服的人手艺很高超啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e530ae20d0f4f984f8af76e8127c2aef08dd1997a55918befcd52a51b96a2b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14107aed9405713cc8254cd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打算挠我痒痒吗？胆子倒是不小。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e57ec3511b7732d40692614d162a453a5bc9c7a3e01e85f894645b12df4658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3f9cf76950889368e6f537",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这极具气势的设计，让我对它一见钟情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ff5e4e7c5111a0b5151640020aa460366b72c7976bda8280d8564554575ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce89ef048c9c197c5f265f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "御寒措施万无一失。不用担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a81fd87fbeb94f4f69eb16842c3c77e7ee809eef8b644c49a20a3da3a1490b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68a26853158facc5c5e13556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是有着悠久传统的制服。要带着骄傲穿戴整齐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c837d0d9beb67877c030ad1f8c205d4272a51468e9732ffe1122e7790a80e809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d0f770d2cb52baf49538a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随观看角度不同，韵味也会改变，真是套充满意趣的服装呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daaa1bbf3f975f7a78148c6fea93dee19fcd11c9c8a0db3b4cc715149f165073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8856bd8a05a75f17acf0a6a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错啊……感觉我的心中也绽放出了花朵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a157e21fd5cfa695062fd422d65913c783772447d99e4c5ce1960854e5a2c1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12794147bdc2dc394078527f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打的蝴蝶结，可是以绝对不会松开而闻名的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f336751b2119b045430071a2ee28d110734d4518bff0d45d01d4c44fb2b8f205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33143a35ae0ca29158a1a38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……偶尔你也要不要试着跳一舞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f6ef5227500e6c60d28897cdee435bb21c3bdee31d2661dbc350b01c54e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04390d5787ef79d4b4dc6ec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一次重新系紧腰带时，我都在叩问自己的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5793809dc94b03f108d3a7c01046ee4baca7669134ce10ab3880650fab0759",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc17f3f756b0b86c43c0e65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裁制得真好。做这件衣服的人手艺很高超啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e530ae20d0f4f984f8af76e8127c2aef08dd1997a55918befcd52a51b96a2b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616699f23ea3b4321b884431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打算挠我痒痒吗？胆子倒是不小。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e57ec3511b7732d40692614d162a453a5bc9c7a3e01e85f894645b12df4658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcc2db28a698916c746e3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea3517e640396b6a9106d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安……怎么，一副没睡醒的眼神。\r\n我们的道路，可没轻松到\r\n能在梦游中前行。快点清醒过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7342c06bedb914d39b162a861af21955987d71567c23c023ab466cda742a3b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:611487ed217d3d3b2430a773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『晨光熹微破晓时，淡隐星辰渐西垂。\r\n聆听风韵祝今朝』……呵。\r\n愿你也能度过美好的一天。努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b49bbcdedd671f7056a0f1eddc39cd75ee872d00f52e2e21b9b946401cd1208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b06dbc3a377bdc9daa04fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用过午餐了吗。若是因忙碌\r\n而怠慢了进食，怠惰之刃便会指向自己\r\n——哪怕吃一点也好。知道了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21f16b449435ba077f5c16652b1567adf60211795b3c686b814a688549e1b8e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd283f2988f2459257277c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然，一到中午大家\r\n眼神都变了呢。想要快点奔跑，\r\n热血沸腾了吧……我也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14e94d52a79ebc2ed448826a6ba943bc5ee093772ecce59858b593e82147961b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60ee9c8e8a69d748fba14fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作结束了吗。……今天\r\n也做得非常出色。我脚步的轻盈\r\n就是明证。明天也期待你的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "969ef39d6b5c1997cfcdabdf228d56fbf63a77e27bd764b616b464016b8f0ece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0fea8c66068edfe75c8621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好一个良夜。这种时候\r\n就该离开书桌，好好享受一下夜色。\r\n怎样，要不要陪我喝一杯茶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ba856d491aee74c3036abd8bf9c97aad158567bb507f2ade2066d2091a3fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d27336a1be07d7088837c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……蝴蝶兰绽放的季节，到了呢。\r\n——那么，要送去俱乐部的那一盆，\r\n该系上什么颜色的装饰绳好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb25c1597f13a7f46a6e5b014f1ec37d1948f8963e03fe1ca1f58bfa2753544e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa61cad9e2a0249c118ac98e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如此酷暑。即使洒水降温，\r\n也犹如杯水车薪吧。\r\n无可奈何……不如去瀑布下修行一番？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2461d6a4dcf98708d9952a95eb8ac07be49e0a169cbfcc7bcf87e7d5cbe8953",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d087643abb62a0d0e8770d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你最近，有看看外面吗。\r\n近来的秋意稍纵即逝。染色的树木、\r\n飒爽的秋风声……无一不是独一无二的珍宝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b00f0eb9a512296a588c7d55a79e5f741391ea5e4b90ce53db44395b24661ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7664eda0a03f4cc8fc3d9afd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是弯腰驼背，心性也会扭曲。\r\n应如严冬下绽放的山茶花一般，\r\n不畏严寒，凛然傲立才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a8cc0f4b496869a1476928ebad63db31ebd057933a54f3949b6d06f55a271b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d26af16f90c4fd35ad1bfbab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fb5b3a6ca3ece3de1bc1435a33d519b8fde7d47ebfe2d122efe0150dd3e033e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5804ac2f4aee17d18f74aa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨光的克服蔬菜料理，\r\n确实非常优秀。大家都能津津有味地吃光。\r\n……当然，白仁除外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cfffeb881d813d3d1405cc83ae95e1b5646f29a80ab6bc7def06071479ee01d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068d509d07f9b4c80f631c9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为白仁时不时会缠着我要，\r\n我对做牡丹饼的手艺还是很有自信的。\r\n下次也做给你尝尝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b7e3c33acc40089d3fd1239699c0965645c7de9653c5993c9f1ce6f4838765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "91001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
